# Frozen, hash-verified artefacts: preserve bytes exactly on every platform.
# No line-ending or encoding conversion, ever, in either direction — the
# whole point of this bundle is that its SHA-256 digests are reproducible by
# a stranger after `git clone`, and any git-side text normalization would
# make verify.py fail on clones with different autocrlf settings even though
# the committed content is correct.
preregistration/* -text
